sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Portal as Norstec Portal
    participant Google
    participant Auth as Authentication provider
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>Portal: Sign in with Google
    Portal->>Auth: Start authentication
    Auth->>Google: Redirect to Google
    Google-->>Auth: Verified identity
    Auth-->>Portal: Authenticated session
    Portal->>DB: Load active membership and role

    alt Active membership exists
        DB-->>Portal: Organization and role
        Portal-->>User: Open the portal
    else No active membership
        DB-->>Portal: No membership
        Portal-->>User: Show onboarding or request status
    end
